ROSETTA MODEL
SOURCE: symbol + layout + material + provenance + context ↓ Interpret relationships & alternatives BRIDGE: invariant + medium-native affordance + known losses ↓ Design, test with appropriate audiences, revise DESTINATION: situated expression + lineage record
A resemblance isn't necessarily a documented historical connection. The tool produces creative hypotheses, not authenticated translations or permission to reproduce restricted cultural materials.
